        "summary": "SimulatorAdapter (and nine other adapters) cache the adapter in a companion object that newInstance only fills when null; in the uberjar the class is shared across reloads, so a live configuration change to the adapter's sources/channels is ignored until restart. Correct: the reloaded counter starts at the new Min 1000.",
